# Database changes go through Lovable

This app's database is Lovable Cloud project `umyzlbrjnklkpxmbdhvf`. There is no separate Supabase dashboard account for it.

When a change needs a new migration under `supabase/migrations/`:

- Write the SQL file in the repo.
- Tell Venus to apply it in Lovable, and name the migration files.
- Do not ask Venus to sign in at supabase.com. A GitHub login there belongs to a different, paused project and cannot run SQL on this database.

After Venus says Lovable finished, verify the new columns or constraints against the live API before treating the migration as applied.
